Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.92,0:01:11.43,Scr,,0,0,0,,{\fs90\c&H494745&\pos(890,5)}等待室
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.55,0:04:41.55,Scr,,0,0,0,,{\fad(850,0)\fn@HYXuanSong 65S\fs95\c&H1E1E1E&\fsp10\pos(845,585)\fay0.01\frz294}接吻
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.35,0:06:50.01,Scr,,0,0,0,,{\fnDFHannotateW7-A\fs30\fax0.08\pos(1096,400)\frz16.21}在吗 在吗
